        "collapsible_text_AaPGYX": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "What's the difference between the TM007 and the upgraded 2025 version?",
            "content": "<p>The <strong>2025 version</strong> of the <strong>TM007</strong> treadmill introduces<strong> three key upgrades</strong> for improved comfort and performance:<br/><br/><strong>Adjustable Handrail Height</strong>: Now ranging <strong>from 39.5 to 52 inches</strong>, with <strong>six levels of adjustment</strong> to better accommodate different users (<strong>previously fixed at 43.7 inches</strong>).  This is <strong>good for kids and the elders</strong>. It is also beneficial <strong>for users taller than 5'8\"</strong>. If you have a <strong>taller</strong> stature, Wellfit recommends choosing the <strong>height-adjustable model</strong> for a better fit to your needs.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_pBaNXc": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Main Specs",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>400 Lbs</strong> Capacity</li><li>Running Area Size：<strong>18×45 in</strong></li><li><strong>0-15%</strong> Auto Incline, <strong>15 Levels</strong></li><li>Speed of <strong>1.0-8.7</strong>mph(Adjustable)</li><li>Product Weight: <strong>92.62</strong> Pounds. If you can lift 33 LBS(15Kg), moving the treadmill will be a breeze.</li><li><strong>Free App</strong> Subscription</li><li>AI Voice Control | Console Control | 3D VR</li><li><strong>3-year</strong> warranty</li><li><strong>30-day</strong> risk free return</li><li>Built-in Bluetooth music player</li><li>Product Expanded Size: <strong>53.54 x 28.74 x 44.1 in</strong></li><li>Product Folding Size: <strong>31.89 x 28.74 x 44.1 in</strong></li><li>Package Size: 53.54 x 27.95 x 8.46 in</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_cMbi3i": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "💰30-Day Lowest Price Guarantee💎",
            "content": "<p>If the price of your purchase drops within 30 days of your order, or if you find the same product available at a lower price through another authorized sales channel, simply contact us. <strong>We'll gladly refund the difference.</strong><br/><br/>*Only applicable to orders placed on or after June 4, 2026.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_etCW8W": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "30-Day Risk-Free Return & 3-Year Warranty Support",
            "content": "<p><a href=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/refund-policy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/refund-policy\"><strong>30-Day Return Window</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Enjoy a simple & <strong>hassle-free return</strong> process — WELLFIT will offer custmers a pre-paid return label when<strong> </strong><a href=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/refund-policy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/refund-policy\"><strong>applicable</strong></a>. Customers don't need to pay for the return shipping.</p><p>How the <strong>3-Year Warranty</strong> Works:</p><ul><li><strong>a)Part Replacement: </strong>Send us a video of the issue, and we'll ship the required parts along with step-by-step video instructions. </li><li><strong>b)Local Repair: </strong>If a local technician is more convenient, you may have the repair done locally with WELLFIT approval. Just send us a video of the issue before repair and a copy of the receipt after-we'll reimburse the cost.</li><li><strong>c)Free Replacement:</strong> If the product cannot be repaired during the warranty period, you will get a free replacement.</li><li><strong>d)Full or Partial Refund: </strong>If repair or replacement isn't feasible or preferred, we may offer a refund based on the product's condition and the issue's severity.</li><li><strong>e)Professional Support:</strong> We provide professional support with a dedicated technical team for online technical assistance.</li></ul><p><strong>*Note:</strong> WELLFIT will evaluate the actual situation and offer our customers best solution.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_4wQ4k6": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Tax-Free",
            "content": "<p>Purchase directly from the WELLFIT treadmill official website and enjoy <strong>tax-free</strong> benefits, as WELLFIT will cover the sales tax. Consumers <strong>do not need to pay the 7%-15% sales tax</strong>.  Compared with buying on other platforms, saving you more.Our official website also honors <strong>3-year </strong>free warranty, while other platform only offer 1-year limited warranty. Strong warranty protection for peace of mind</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_TCr478": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What's in The Box",
            "content": "<ul><li>1 x Treadmill</li><li>1 x User Manual</li><li>1 x Power Cable</li><li>2 x Lubricants</li><li>2 x Nano Fixate Gel Pads</li><li>1 x Water Bottle Cage</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "text_rFKQct": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>⚠️ Note:</strong> <strong>Only</strong> the handrails on the <strong>2025 version</strong> are adjustable. If you need adjustable handrails, consider the <a href=\"/products/tm032-foldable-treadmill-with-auto-incline\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"[New]TM032 Height-Adjustable Treadmill with 10% Auto Incline 17*44 Inch Running Area\"><strong>TM032</strong></a>, or a larger model like the <a href=\"/products/tm029-pro-treadmill\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"2026 TM029 Pro Heavy Duty Treadmill With 15% Auto Incline\"><strong>TM029</strong></a> (TM029’s handrails are fixed, but the machine is taller).</p>"
          }
